# Plugin builds

Release build and install (VST3 + CLAP, macOS user plugin folders):

```bash
./scripts/install.sh
```

The script bundles with `cargo xtask bundle composure --release`, then copies and ad-hoc signs:

- `~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3/Composure.vst3`
- `~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/CLAP/Composure.clap`

When asked to compile, build, or install the plugin, run `./scripts/install.sh` from `Composure_Rust` — not plain `cargo build`.
